# Direct pins for the execution environment. The compiled file is
# execution-environment-requirements.txt. Rebuild that file with
# `uv pip compile` when a pin here changes; the image build installs it
# with `pip install --require-hashes` and does not resolve ranges.
#
# Versions are the ones the smoked image already ran, which satisfy the
# ranges in each collection requirements.txt.
